@PizzaStore.Controllers_HostAddress = http://localhost:5108

### Get all pizzas
GET {{PizzaStore.Controllers_HostAddress}}/pizza
Accept: application/json

### Get pizza by ID
GET {{PizzaStore.Controllers_HostAddress}}/pizza/1
Accept: application/json

### Get a pizza that doesn't exist
GET {{PizzaStore.Controllers_HostAddress}}/pizza/5
Accept: application/json

### Existing WeatherForecast endpoint
GET {{PizzaStore.Controllers_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json
